			"updated": 1772816275719,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "In distributed systems, many computers (called nodes) work together over a network.\nConsensus means all these nodes must agree on a single value or decision — even when\nthings go wrong, like network delays or crashed machines.",
			"rawText": "In distributed systems, many computers (called nodes) work together over a network. Consensus means all these nodes must agree on a single value or decision — even when things go wrong, like network delays or crashed machines.",
