				}
			],
			"updated": 1773389534444,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Story:\n\nSeveral generals are surrounding a city:\n    -> If all generals attack together → they win.\n    -> If some attack and some retreat → they lose.\n\nThe Problem\n    -> Generals communicate using messengers But some generals may be traitors.\n\nGeneral A → Attack\nGeneral B → Attack\nGeneral C → Traitor\n\nServer A\nServer B\nServer C\nServer D\n\n\n",
			"rawText": "Story:\n\nSeveral generals are surrounding a city:\n    -> If all generals attack together → they win.\n    -> If some attack and some retreat → they lose.\n\nThe Problem\n    -> Generals communicate using messengers But some generals may be traitors.\n\nGeneral A → Attack\nGeneral B → Attack\nGeneral C → Traitor\n\nServer A\nServer B\nServer C\nServer D\n\n\n",
			"fontSize": 19.77125,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Story:\n\nSeveral generals are surrounding a city:\n    -> If all generals attack together → they win.\n    -> If some attack and some retreat → they lose.\n\nThe Problem\n    -> Generals communicate using messengers But some generals may be traitors.\n\nGeneral A → Attack\nGeneral B → Attack\nGeneral C → Traitor\n\nServer A\nServer B\nServer C\nServer D\n\n\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
